# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hammertoe's Digsite

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  zone Badlands
  tip Head back west to the road and follow it south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands. Prospector Ryedol and Sigrun Ironhew camp side by side at the dig.
  accept 719 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Prospector Ryedol
  accept 718 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sigrun Ironhew

step Badlands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map and Dorgaron's mining helmet lie among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick and Dorgaron's artifacts. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it.
  accept 720 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Crumpled Map
  collect 7846 quest 2500 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Crag Coyote Fang
  collect 4616 quest 719 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Ryedol's Lucky Pick
  collect 7847 quest 2500 @50.0,60.0 map 1418 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Buzzard Gizzard, if you still need one: the Buzzards east of Agmond's End drop it only rarely

step The excavation crate
  tip Head north-east to the abandoned dig; the supply crate lies there among the Dustbelcher ogres.
  collect 4629 quest 718 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Supply Crate

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  note Ryedol's next errand goes into Uldaman: skip it.
  turnin 718 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sigrun Ironhew
  accept 733 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 720 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 719 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Prospector Ryedol

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The middle

step Valley of Fangs
  tip Martek and Rigglefuzz camp together in the Valley of Fangs, in the middle of the Badlands.
  turnin 1106 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1108 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 703 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Rigglefuzz
  accept 705 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The clams lie on Stranglethorn's north-west coast, in the next guide: keep it

step Agmond's End
  tip The battered skeleton lies just east of the ogres, at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; the Bonesnappers and Shamans around it drop the flakes. Theldurin sits by the ruined camp further south.
  turnin 738 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Battered Dwarven Skeleton

step Agmond's End: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip Careful: the Stonevault Bonesnappers are 39-40 and the Shamans 40-41, a level or two over you here: pull them from the camp's edge, one at a time.
  accept 739 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Battered Dwarven Skeleton
  collect 3404 quest 703 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Buzzard Wing
  note Murdaloc himself (42) walks among the Bonesnappers: leave him for the later Badlands guide at 43, and kill the Bonesnappers for this quest now.
  collect 5797 quest 1108 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Indurium Flake
  kill 2893 quest 739 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Stonevault Bonesnapper
  kill 2945 quest 739 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Murdaloc

step Theldurin the Lost
  when group 709
  tip Theldurin sits by the ruined camp south of the trogg camp. His tablet lies just inside Uldaman's cave mouth, beside level 38 elites: a quest for a group.
  accept 709                          -- Theldurin the Lost

step Lotwil Veriatus
  tip Head west into the Dustbowl; Lotwil works by his machines in the middle of it.
  accept 710 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

