# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step The Ancient Chest
  when group 709
  tip Head north to Uldaman's entrance, in the north of the Badlands: the chest lies just inside the cave mouth. Magregan Deepshadow and the Obsidian Golems (38) stand beside it and Shadowforge Diggers (35-36) work the tunnel, all elite: keep your group together.
  collect 4631 quest 709              -- Tablet of Ryun'eh; below ground

step Valley of Fangs
  tip Martek and Rigglefuzz camp in the Valley of Fangs, on the road between Uldaman and Agmond's End.
  turnin 1108 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1137 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- For Fizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway: the Tanaris guide passes him at 45, keep it
  turnin 703 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Rigglefuzz

step Sigrun Ironhew
  tip East from the Valley of Fangs to Hammertoe's Digsite: Sigrun Ironhew takes the scrap metal.
  turnin 733 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sigrun Ironhew

step Theldurin the Lost
  when group 709
  tip Head south to Agmond's End.
  turnin 709

step Rock Elementals
  tip The Rock Elementals roam south-east of Lotwil; Giant Buzzards and Elder Crag Coyotes share the plain to their west. Careful: a Malevolent Mirage, a level 42 elite, drifts about the Dustbowl: give it a wide berth.
  collect 4627 quest 711 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Large Stone Slab

